        <p><seg source="#source-3506-3530">昭和二十八年十月</seg><seg type="layout" source="#source-3530-3572" rend="chitsuki align(right) offset-from-end(2)" snh:layout-kind="chitsuki" snh:layout-params="align=right;offset-from-end=2"><seg source="#source-3560-3572">中村研一</seg></seg></p>
      </div>
